  "editor": {
    "notes": "Brain Blitz v2 owns unscaled DOM flow. Portrait uses four answer rows, landscape independent question/2x2 answers. Short and long content scroll inside a bounded local root. All controls >=44px. Repeated answer/primary/HUD skins and tiny semantic icons are intentionally fixed to their content boxes (nine-slice caps); question and background are asset-capable regions. No authored world coordinates. Host owns raw Telegram insets. Production integration subtracts the measured stage boundary from viewport safe insets; only the remaining portions pad local content and pause dialog."
